# The training notebook writes the exported category classifier here.
# The worker container reads this directory at /app/models.
#
# Artifacts the notebook should leave in this folder:
#   the category classifier, in the format loader.py will read
#   category_labels.json    label order used by that classifier
#   evaluation_summary.json per-class precision, recall, and F1;
#                           priority performance; urgent-ticket recall;
#                           human-review rate; the confidence threshold you chose
#
# Generated files in this directory are gitignored. This file stays.
